          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Link Checklist</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Open in private browser. Check desktop and mobile layouts. Confirm offer name, amount, currency, quantity. Complete test-mode transaction. Check confirmation shown to buyer. Check payment/order record. Check contact record. Check receipt or notification. Check booking, delivery, or follow-up step.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Test Mode Warning -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-rose-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-rose-100">
